        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liam Cunningham, Michael Fassbender, Keith Barron\n- Works: Police 2020\n- Roles: DCI Billy O'Connell, Eddie Longshaw\n- Topics: Irish actors, television pilot plot\n\nFacts:\n- Liam Cunningham was born on 2 June 1961 and is an Irish stage and screen actor.\n- Michael Fassbender was born on 2 April 1977 and is an Irish actor.\n- In the near-future pilot Police 2020, Liam Cunningham starred as DCI Billy O'Connell, the head of a police nightshift force.\n- In Police 2020, DCI Billy O'Connell is tasked with confronting Eddie Longshaw, played by Keith Barron.\n- In Police 2020, Eddie Longshaw takes a group of Russian immigrants hostage in an elevator.\n- In Police 2020, Eddie Longshaw blames the immigrant population for a tuberculosis outbreak that took the lives of most of his family.",
